  "title": "How to Use This Guide",
  "body": " How to Use This Guide  This is not a textbook. Our required text is Game Theory in Action by Stephen Schecter and Herbert Gintis. In these notes, we expand on the reading by adding in interactive games, concept check questions, and additional analysis of some things in the reading.  "
