  "title": "Finite Horizon Games and a Critique of Backward Induction",
  "body": " Finite Horizon Games and a Critique of Backward Induction  This page has two quick readings from the book. We won't be going into more of the technical details here.   Section 1.12, Backward Induction for Finite Horizon Games   Read Section 1.12 (quickly).   You can just read and get the gist for this section. We aren't going further into this at the moment!   And now for a somewhat reflective reading.   Section 1.13, Critique of Backward Induction   Read Section 1.13.   This is an interesting reading that you should go through to think about some of the bigger picture behind backward induction. There is not any technical information from this section that we need to spend time on right now.    "
