  "title": "",
  "body": "  Section 3.2.4 ends by asking you a question directly. If you were Alice, which event would you go to, and why? There's no single right answer here! Notice that the definition of Nash equilibrium gives you no help at all in choosing between the two equilibria, which is a gap in the theory rather than a gap in your understanding. Chapter 5 comes back to it.   "
